### Configuration Variables
# Change @baseUrl to your live Cloudflare Worker URL when testing in production
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:8787
@baseUrl = https://expense-tracker.ashishjha.dev

# Replace with the value of INGESTION_TOKEN from your .dev.vars / Cloudflare Secrets
@token = your_ingestion_token_here


### 1. Health Check (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### 2. Capture Transaction (Ingest SMS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/capture
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sender": "IDFCFB-S",
  "message": "Spent Rs.555.16 from A/C XX4870 at Zomato Online Order on 13/10/26. Not you? Call 180010888/SMS BLOCK (last 4 digit of card) to 5676732. IDFC FIRST Bank"
}


### 3. Reprocess Unparsed Transactions (1 to 5 IDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reprocess
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ids": [
    "2f2702224a68e09bb6094258993c7e03c44d567c0ccdb1d127f81b5470e730e2",
    "85cc82b58204606f5419680e3bcdaf6e2b90b6c43fb0862b4dec7ad6802f2c4d"
  ]
}


### 4. Update Transaction Category
# Useful if an expense lands in 'other' and you want to categorize it (e.g. 'travel', 'food', 'bills', 'clothing', etc.)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "category": "travel"
}


### 5. Exclude Transaction (e.g., Friends/Family Card Usage)
# Sets exclude = 1 so it is hidden from the dashboard feed and omitted from all expense metrics
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "exclude": true
}


### 6. Un-exclude / Restore Transaction
# Sets exclude = 0 to restore it back to regular calculations and feed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "exclude": false
}


